<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>404 - Ruby Logic Error | Ruby Programming Challenge</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="assets/Ruby Logo.png">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Play:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #0d0d0d;
            --text-primary: #f0f0f0;
            --text-secondary: #a0a0a0;
            --accent-ruby: #e0115f;
            --accent-crimson: #990000;
            --font-heading: 'Play', sans-serif;
            --font-body: 'Play', sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% -20%, #1a1a1a 0%, #0d0d0d 100%);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            font-family: var(--font-body);
            height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .error-code {
            font-family: var(--font-heading);
            font-size: 12rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 0;
            line-height: 1;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-ruby), var(--accent-crimson));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            position: relative;
            animation: glitch 2s infinite linear alternate-reverse;
        }

        @keyframes glitch {
            0% { transform: translate(0); filter: hue-rotate(0deg); }
            20% { transform: translate(-3px, 3px); }
            40% { transform: translate(-3px, -3px); filter: hue-rotate(45deg); }
            60% { transform: translate(3px, 3px); }
            80% { transform: translate(3px, -3px); filter: hue-rotate(-45deg); }
            100% { transform: translate(0); }
        }

        .message {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 2rem 0 3rem;
            font-weight: 300;
        }

        .btn-home {
            padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
            background: rgba(224, 17, 95, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-ruby);
            color: var(--accent-ruby);
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-family: var(--font-heading);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .btn-home:hover {
            background: var(--accent-ruby);
            color: white;
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(224, 17, 95, 0.4);
        }

        footer {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 2rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .author-link {
            color: var(--text-primary);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .author-link:hover {
            color: var(--accent-ruby);
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <h1 class="error-code">404</h1>
    <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 2.8rem; margin-top: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Logic Error!</h2>

    <div class="message" style="margin-bottom: 2rem; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 1.15rem; opacity: 0.8;">
        <p style="margin: 0.5rem 0;">You've hit an undefined route in the Ruby Challenge.</p>
        <p style="margin: 0.5rem 0;">This object hasn't been instantiated yet.</p>
        <p style="margin: 0.5rem 0;">Return to the main module to re-evaluate your scope.</p>
    </div>

    <a href="index.html" class="btn-home" style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">Evaluate Home Scope</a>

    <footer>
        <p>Created by <a href="https://github.com/Amey-Thakur" class="author-link" target="_blank">Amey Thakur</a> & <a
                href="https://github.com/msatmod" class="author-link" target="_blank">Mega Satish</a> • &copy; 2022</p>
    </footer>
</body>

</html>
